1324:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         requires a timer reset to avoid unexpected direction
1325:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         due to DIR bit readonly in center aligned mode.
