2633:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   Switching from Center Aligned counter mode to Edge counter mode (or reverse)
2634:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         requires a timer reset to avoid unexpected direction
2635:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         due to DIR bit readonly in center aligned mode.
