2638:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         channels 1 and channel 2 are reserved and cannot be used for other
2639:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         purpose.
